tion() {\n      const smsPhoneFields = document.querySelectorAll(\'[id^=\"country-select-\"]\');\n      \n      smsPhoneFields.forEach(function(dropdown) {\n        const fieldName = dropdown?.id.replace(\'country-select-\', \'\');\n        initializeSmsPhoneDropdown(fieldName);\n      });\n    });\n    </script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sign Up for The Next Chapter: A Spark the Journey Book Club','','publish','closed','closed','','sign-up-for-the-next-chapter','','','2026-01-15 23:50:53','2026-01-15 23:50:53','',0,'https://sparkthejourney.org/?page_id=89725',0,'page','',0),(89866,2,'2026-04-06 16:24:37','2026-04-06 16:24:37','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>April 6, 2026</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What shapes a young person’s future more — circumstance or who shows up for them?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we continue our journey through <em>My Seven Black Fathers</em> with Spark the Journey\'s book club, one idea from the opening chapters hasn\'t left me:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The difference between potential realized and potential lost is often who is present in a young person\'s life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Early in the book, we meet Will navigating real loss—an absent father, a close friend gone too soon, and environments that didn\'t always affirm who he was. What strikes me isn\'t just the weight of those experiences. It\'s what liberated Will from them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Joseph, his stepfather, quietly took a seat beside him when his father wasn\'t there. Mr. Williams, his teacher, reflected his worth back to him when the world around him was chipping it away. The barbershop — a room full of men who looked like him — reminded him, without a word of instruction, that he belonged.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>None of these people had all the answers. They just showed up. And that changed everything.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a leader, that resonates deeply. We talk a lot about systems, programs, and pipelines. But underneath all of it is something more fundamental — the question of whether a young person has someone in their corner who sees them consistently, over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For many young Black boys, the spaces they move through can quietly erode that sense of belonging. Mentorship has the power to interrupt that narrative. Not because mentors are perfect, but because their presence is a statement in itself: you matter, and I\'m not going anywhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That\'s the commitment driving our work at Spark the Journey and it\'s what this book continues to bring into focus for me.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To those following along with our book club: which moments in Will\'s story have stayed with you? If you have yet to join and want to read along with us, <a href=\"https://lnkd.in/eG-jRWHJ\">join here</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>About Spark the Journey:</strong> Spark the Journey is a non-profit&nbsp;organization&nbsp;that provides mentorship and a community of support for young adults to chart their own paths to achieving college and career success.&nbsp;We envision a future where every young person can attain economic mobility, regardless of education, background, or race. If you are interested in supporting our work, learn more about <a href=\"https://sparkthejourney.org/get-involved/\">how to get involved</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','A Reflection and Journey Through the Book, My Seven Black Fathers.','','publish','closed','closed','','a-reflection-and-journey-through-the-book-my-seven-black-fathers','','','2026-04-06 16:24:37','2026-04-06 16:24:37','',0,'https://sparkthejourney.org/?p=89866',0,'post','',0),(89882,2,'2026-06-12 18:10:55','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>April 6, 2026</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>My Journey Continues 2026&nbsp;- Azlyn</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;<br><strong>What are your plans for college next year?</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For college next year I plan&nbsp;on focusing&nbsp;a lot on my faith as&nbsp;I\'m&nbsp;going to a Christian Evangelical college and I plan&nbsp;on continuing&nbsp;to audition to&nbsp;various different&nbsp;plays while&nbsp;I\'m&nbsp;there. I also plan&nbsp;on doing&nbsp;marching&nbsp;band&nbsp;since I did wind percussion in&nbsp;high school.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What are you most excited about as you get ready for college or your next step?</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;One thing I am most excited&nbsp;for&nbsp;as&nbsp;I take my&nbsp;next step towards college&nbsp;is that I will be able&nbsp;to meet and get to know so many new and amazing people. I want to step out of my comfort zone and do things I normally&nbsp;wouldn\'t&nbsp;have the courage to do.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What’s&nbsp;one career goal or dream&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;working toward as you graduate?&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;One career goal and dream that&nbsp;I\'m&nbsp;working towards as I graduate is that I want to be a Judge or diplomat. I have always been fascinated with how the law&nbsp;works&nbsp;and I want to be able to help&nbsp;everyone.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What’s&nbsp;one lesson or skill&nbsp;you’ve&nbsp;learned from Spark the Journey that you think will help you succeed in your next chapter?&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One skill that&nbsp;I\'ve&nbsp;learned at Spark the Journey that will help me succeed in the next chapter of my life is the ability to speak up for myself. They have helped me grow the courage to speak up not only for myself and when there is injustice, but also for those who are unable to speak up for themselves.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Can you describe in your own words how Spark has&nbsp;impacted&nbsp;you and your life?&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Spark has made&nbsp;a huge impact&nbsp;in my life. It was through this program that I got to meet my amazing&nbsp;mentor&nbsp;and I was also able to grow closer with my friends. I got to meet a lot of awesome people and&nbsp;I\'m&nbsp;grateful for all the opportunities Spark provided me to be able to learn and grow into the person I am today.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>About Spark the Journey:</strong> Spark the Journey is a non-profit&nbsp;organization&nbsp;that provides mentorship and a community of support for young adults to chart their own paths to achieving college and career success.&nbsp;We envision a future where every young person can attain economic mobility, regardless of education, background, or race. If you are interested in supporting our work, learn more about <a href=\"https://sparkthejourney.org/get-involved/\">how to get involved</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','A Reflection and Journey Through the Book, My Seven Black Fathers.','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2026-06-12 18:10:55','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://sparkthejourney.org/?p=89882',0,'post','',0),(89883,2,'2026-06-12 18:23:36','2026-06-12 18:23:36','<!-- wp:acf/custom-text {\"name\":\"acf/custom-text\",\"data\":{\"ct_background_color\":\"blue\",\"_ct_background_color\":\"field_5e57cc7980f66\",\"ct_text\":\"Each year, as part of our My Journey Continues campaign, Spark celebrates our graduating seniors and all the hard work they’ve put into preparing for the next chapter of their lives. Read on to learn about just a few of our talented participants and what they’ve accomplished during their time with Spark the Journey.\",\"_ct_text\":\"field_5e57cc6a80f65\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/custom-text-image {\"name\":\"acf/custom-text-image\",\"data\":{\"cti_title\":\"My Journey Continues at Wheaton College\",\"_cti_title\":\"field_5e57d3e32a9c8\",\"cti_text\":\"\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eWhat are your plans for college next year?\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eFor college next year I plan on focusing a lot on my faith as I\'m going to a Christian Evangelical college and I plan on continuing to audition to various different plays while I\'m there. I also plan on doing marching band since I did wind percussion in high school.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eWhat are you most excited about as you get ready for college or your next step?\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003e One thing I am most excited for as I take my next step towards college is that I will be able to meet and get to know so many new and amazing people. I want to step out of my comfort zone and do things I normally wouldn\'t have the courage to do.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eWhat’s one career goal or dream you’re working toward as you graduate?  \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003e One career goal and dream that I\'m working towards as I graduate is that I want to be a Judge or diplomat. I have always been fascinated with how the law works and I want to be able to help everyone.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eWhat’s one lesson or skill you’ve learned from Spark the Journey that you think will help you succeed in your next chapter?  \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eOne skill that I\'ve learned at Spark the Journey that will help me succeed in the next chapter of my life is the ability to speak up for myself. They have helped me grow the courage to speak up not only for myself and when there is injustice, but also for those who are unable to speak up for themselves. \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eCan you describe in your own words how Spark has impacted you and your life? \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cspan data-contrast=\\u0022auto\\u0022\\u003eSpark has made a huge impact in my life. It was through this program that I got to meet my amazing mentor and I was also able to grow closer with my friends. I got to meet a lot of awesome people and I\'m grateful for all the opportunities Spark provided me to be able to learn and grow into the person I am today.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\\u0022{}\\u0022\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"_cti_text\":\"field_5e57d3ee2a9c9\",\"cti_link\":\"\",\"_cti_link\":\"field_5e57d3fa2a9ca\",\"cti_image\":89898,\"_cti_image\":\"field_5e57d4082a9cb\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->','My Journey Continues - Azlyn','','publish','closed','closed','','my-journey-continues-azlyn','','','2026-06-12 18:23:36','2026-06-12 18:23:36','',0,'https://sparkthejourney.org/?p=89883',0,'post','',0),(89884,1,'2026-07-20 20:37:45','2026-07-17 19:53:28',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','89884','','','2026-07-20 20:37:45','2026-07-20 20:37:45','',0,'http://localhost: